l,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-04-27T11:41:47Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T14:55:54Z","closed_at":"2025-04-28T11:54:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105820","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105820","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105820.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105820.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"`AspectRatioContainer` uses `float` for the aspect ratio. This makes it easy to introduce errors when using non-integral ratio.\r\n\r\nFor example, the value would be `1.7778` for 16:9 aspect ratio. A 640x480 container would make its children `640x359.995` at position `(0,60.002)`.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes `AspectRatioContainer` use `Vector2` for the aspect ratio, i.e., the user specifies `(16,9)` instead of `1.7778`, minimizing errors.\r\n\r\n- A new `aspect` property is introduced.\r\n- The old `ratio` property is marked as deprecated, hidden from the inspector, and acts as a proxy for `aspect`.","closed_by":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.